        <briefdescription>
<para>Science computation for gocart wet-removal scheme. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Routes sulfate species (SO4/SO2/DMS/MSA) through GOCART&apos;s SU_Wet_Removal and all other aerosol species through GOCART&apos;s WetRemovalUFS. H2O2 is used only as an auxiliary input to SU_Wet_Removal (to cap soluble SO2) and is not itself wet-deposited.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">num_layers</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of vertical layers </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">num_species</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of chemical species </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">params</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Scheme parameters (pre-validated by host) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">mairden</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>MAIRDEN field (moist air density) [kg/m3] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">pedge</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>PEDGE field (level-edge air pressure) [Pa] (num_layers+1) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">pfilsan</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>PFILSAN field (3D flux of ice nonconvective precip) [kg/m2/s] (num_layers+1) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">pfllsan</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>PFLLSAN field (3D flux of liquid nonconvective precip) [kg/m2/s] (num_layers+1) </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">preccon</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>PRECCON field (convective precip at ground) [m] - divided by tstep -&gt; [m/s] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">preclsc</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>PRECLSC field (large-scale precip at ground) [m] - divided by tstep -&gt; [m/s] </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">t</parametername>
